          }
        }
      }
    },
    "90 days": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "90日"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "90 天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "90 days from now": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今から90日"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从现在起 90 天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A box you empty keeps what it already says; these can be changed here but not cleared.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "入力欄を空にしても、いまの値がそのまま残ります。ここでは変更はできますが、消すことはできません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清空某个输入框并不会清除原值，原来的内容仍会保留；这些项可以在这里改，但不能清空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A brief each morning": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "毎朝のブリーフ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每天早晨的简报"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A browser that did not say what it is": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名乗らなかったブラウザー"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未表明身份的浏览器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A certificate supplied by hand, in PEM, used when certificates are not obtained automatically. Relative paths are resolved against the configuration directory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自分で用意した PEM 形式の証明書で、自動取得を使わないときに用います。相対パスは設定ディレクトリから解決されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手工提供的 PEM 格式证书，在不自动申请证书时使用。相对路径按配置目录解析。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A coding session asks you": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "コーディングセッションからの質問"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有个编程会话在问你"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A coding session finished": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "コーディングセッションが終わりました"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有个编程会话完成了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A corrected form": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "訂正されたフォーム"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更正后的表格"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A disabled alias is ignored, as if it were not there. It stays so it can be turned back on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無効にしたエイリアスは、存在しないものとして扱われます。あとで有効に戻せるよう、残されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已停用的别名会被忽略，就像它不存在一样。它会保留，以便日后重新启用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A disabled credential is refused. It stays so it can be turned back on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無効にした認証情報は拒否されます。あとで有効に戻せるよう、残されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已停用的凭据会被拒绝。它会保留，以便日后重新启用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A disabled person cannot sign in. Their mail and memberships are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無効にした人はサインインできません。メールと所属は保持されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已停用的人无法登录。其邮件和群组关系会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A dream that marked documents read without reading them can be put right: everything it marked in the last so many minutes goes back into the queue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "読まずに既読と記録した夢は直せます。指定した分数のあいだに記録されたドキュメントがキューに戻ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果某次梦境把文档标记为已读却并未读过，可以在这里纠正：最近这些分钟内被标记的文档会重新回到队列。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A duplicate's category does not count.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重複した取引のカテゴリは集計されません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重复交易的类别不计入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A feature off here is hidden from every person and refused by the API; what they had on resumes when it comes back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ここで無効にした機能は全員から隠され、API でも拒否されます。戻せば以前の設定が再開します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在此关闭的功能对所有人隐藏并被 API 拒绝；重新开启后恢复原有设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A folder of JSON-lines records, filled by a refresh script; ask the agent to write one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JSON Lines のレコードを収めたフォルダーで、リフレッシュスクリプトが中身を満たします。エージェントに書いてもらえます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个装着 JSON 行记录的文件夹，由刷新脚本填充；可以让助理替你写一个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A goal needs you": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目標があなたを必要としています"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有个目标需要你"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A group is the only thing a role or a domain is attached to: everyone in it holds its roles, over its domains for the domain permissions and everywhere for the rest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ロールとドメインはグループにだけ結び付きます。グループの全員がそのロールを持ち、ドメイン権限はグループのドメインに、それ以外はサーバー全体に及びます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "角色和域名只挂在群组上：群组里的每个人都持有群组的角色，域名权限作用于群组的域名，其余权限作用于整个服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A guess": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推測"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推测"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A headless Chrome the operator runs beside the server, reached over the DevTools protocol. Every run starts as a clean visitor.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サーバーの横で運用者が動かすヘッドレス Chrome。DevTools プロトコルで接続します。実行はいつも新規の訪問者として始まります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运维者在服务器旁运行的无头 Chrome，通过 DevTools 协议连接。每次运行都以全新访客身份开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A layout is what goes around a template: the header, the footer, the styles.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "レイアウトはテンプレートを包むもので、ヘッダー、フッター、スタイルにあたります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "布局是包在模板外面的部分：页眉、页脚、样式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A mailbox is made when an address is given to you on your server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サーバーでアドレスが割り当てられるとメールボックスが作られます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器为你分配地址后就会创建邮箱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A message asking to leave is sent from this mailbox.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このメールボックスから解除を求めるメッセージを送ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会从这个邮箱发送一封退订邮件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A model the list does not offer yet, written provider:model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一覧にまだないモデル。provider:model の形で書きます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列表中还没有的模型，写作 provider:model。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A note about this charge": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この支払いについてのメモ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于这笔扣款的备注"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A page in the graph, such as projects. Leave it empty and your agent files what it finds where it thinks it belongs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "グラフ内のページ（たとえば projects）。空のままならエージェントが置き場所を決めます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图谱中的一个页面，例如 projects。留空则由助手自行决定归档的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A passkey signs a challenge with a key your phone, laptop or security key holds and never gives out. There is no shared secret, so there is nothing to leak or be phished out of you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "パスキーは、スマートフォンやノートパソコン、セキュリティキーが保持し外部に出さない鍵でチャレンジに署名します。共有の秘密がないため、漏えいもフィッシングもできません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通行密钥用你的手机、笔记本或安全密钥所持有、从不外传的私钥来签署挑战。没有共享的秘密，也就没有可泄露或被钓走的东西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A phone with no name": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名前のないスマートフォン"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未命名的手机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A picture you put in a template is fetched by the reader’s mail program over HTTPS, from a name under this domain. That is a different question from where mail arrives: the host a mail server name points at may answer HTTPS with something else entirely, and then the mail is fine while every picture in it is broken.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "テンプレートに入れた画像は、このドメインの名前から HTTPS で取得されます。これはメールの到着先とは別の問題です。メールサーバー名が指すホストの 443 番ポートが別のものであれば、メール自体は届いても画像だけが全部壊れます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你放在模板里的图片，由读信人的邮件客户端通过 HTTPS 从本域名下的一个主机名拉取。这与邮件从哪里收是两回事：邮件服务器名指向的主机，其 443 端口可能属于别的东西，那时邮件本身正常，里面的图片却全部加载不出来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A provider is a model service, named however you like; a model is always written provider:model. The openai kind covers every server that speaks the same API, including a local one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "プロバイダーはモデルサービスで、名前は自由です。モデルは常に provider:model と書きます。openai 種別は同じ API を話すすべてのサーバー(ローカルのものも)を含みます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提供方是一个模型服务，名称任意；模型总是写作 provider:model。openai 类型涵盖所有使用相同 API 的服务器，包括本地的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A role is a named set of permissions. The three seeded ones are ordinary roles: rename, edit or delete them like any other.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ロールは名前の付いた権限の集まりです。あらかじめ用意された 3 つも普通のロールで、名前の変更・編集・削除ができます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "角色是一组命名的权限。预置的三个角色与其他角色无异：可以重命名、编辑或删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rule files every transaction whose merchant or description has its words, ignoring case.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ルールは店舗名か説明にその語を含む取引をすべて分類します（大文字小文字は区別しません）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "规则会归类所有商家或描述中含有这些字词的交易，不区分大小写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rule now files “%@” here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」はルールでここに分類されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "现在有规则会把“%@”归到这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A sender connecting to a domain is then handed a certificate for the name it asked for, rather than one naming a different domain. Each name must reach this server on port 80 for the certificate to be obtained. Turning this off stops renewals; certificates already issued stay in place until they expire.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接続してきた送信側には、要求した名前の証明書が渡されるようになります（別のドメイン名ではなく）。取得には各名前がポート 80 でこのサーバーに到達できる必要があります。オフにすると更新は止まりますが、取得済みの証明書は有効期限まで使われます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这样，连接某个域名的发信方拿到的证书就是它请求的名称，而不是另一个域名的名称。每个名称都必须能通过 80 端口访问本服务器才能签发证书。关闭后将停止续期，已签发的证书在到期前仍继续使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A session lasts": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "セッションの有効期間"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话有效期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A setup token works once. To link through Plaid, use the dashboard.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "セットアップトークンは一度だけ使えます。Plaid で連携するにはダッシュボードを使ってください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置令牌只能使用一次。要通过 Plaid 关联，请使用控制台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A template is a message this domain sends by name: an application calls the send endpoint with the name and the values. Each can be translated into as many languages as its readers speak.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "テンプレートは、このドメインが名前で送るメールです。アプリケーションが名前と値を添えて送信エンドポイントを呼びます。読み手の言語の数だけ翻訳できます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模板是此域名按名称发送的邮件：应用程序带着名称和变量值调用发送接口。每个模板都可以翻译成读者所用的任意多种语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A token authenticates the command line tool the way a password authenticates a browser. On the server itself no token is needed; these are for administering it from somewhere else.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ブラウザーにとってのパスワードが、コマンドラインツールにとってのトークンです。サーバー本体ではトークンは要りません。別の場所から管理するためのものです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "令牌之于命令行工具，就像密码之于浏览器。在服务器本机上不需要令牌；令牌是为了从别的机器管理它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tool call could not be read, so it was asked for again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "読み取れないツール呼び出しがあったため、もう一度依頼しました。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有一个工具调用无法读取，已重新请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A voice you named before": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以前名前を付けた声"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你之前命名过的声音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A year": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1年"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一年"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A year from now": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今から1年"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从现在起一年"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A year, a month or a day: 2023, 2023-06 or 2023-06-14.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "年・月・日のいずれか：2023、2023-06、2023-06-14。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "年、月或日：2023、2023-06 或 2023-06-14。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accrued market discount": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "経過市場割引"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应计市场折价"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add mail, calendars, reminders and contacts to the apps already on an iPhone or Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone や Mac にあるアプリに、メール、カレンダー、リマインダー、連絡先を追加します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将邮件、日历、提醒事项和联系人添加到 iPhone 或 Mac 上已有的应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Address copied": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アドレスをコピーしました"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已复制地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "all follow-ups": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべてのフォロー"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有跟进"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answer its question first": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先に質問に答えてください"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先回答它的问题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answer with these": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これで答える"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用这些回答"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asking": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "質問中"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在提问"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close tab": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "タブを閉じる"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭标签页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close this coding session?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このコーディングセッションを閉じますか？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭这个编程会话？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Closed %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ を閉じました"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已关闭 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Coding": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "コーディング"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编程"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Coding agent": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "コーディングエージェント"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编程助手"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Directory": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ディレクトリ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each week your agent finds what is on near you for the weekend and the week after, and tells you on this day at this time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エージェントは毎週、週末とその次の週に近所で開かれることを調べ、この曜日のこの時刻にお伝えします。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理每周会查找你附近这个周末和下一周有什么活动，并在这一天的这个时间告诉你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look around town on": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "近所を調べる曜日"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看附近活动的日子"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name in herdr": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "herdr での名前"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 herdr 中的名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New tab": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新しいタブ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新建标签页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No coding sessions": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "コーディングセッションはありません"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有编程会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing has been said in this session yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このセッションではまだ何も話していません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个会话里还没有对话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On screen": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "表示中"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open a coding session": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "コーディングセッションを開く"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开编程会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open a session": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "セッションを開く"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open one with the plus button, or start Claude Code or Codex in herdr on your computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "＋ボタンで開くか、コンピューターの herdr で Claude Code や Codex を起動してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击加号打开一个，或在电脑的 herdr 中启动 Claude Code 或 Codex。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show earlier turns": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以前のやり取りを表示"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示更早的对话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show on computer": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "コンピューターで表示"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在电脑上显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show the screen": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面を表示"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示屏幕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show the turns": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "やり取りを表示"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示对话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shown on %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ で表示しました"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已在 %@ 上显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip approvals and the sandbox (--yolo)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "承認とサンドボックスを省く (--yolo)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跳过审批和沙箱 (--yolo)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip permission prompts (--dangerously-skip-permissions)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "権限の確認を省く (--dangerously-skip-permissions)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跳过权限确认 (--dangerously-skip-permissions)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell me when it finishes": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "終わったら知らせる"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成时告诉我"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Telling you when it finishes": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "終わったら知らせます"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成时会告诉你"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The coding sessions could not be read": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "コーディングセッションを読み込めませんでした"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取编程会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This ends %@ in %@ on %@ and closes its pane. What was said stays in its history.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%3$@ の %2$@ の %1$@ を終了し、ペインを閉じます。やり取りは履歴に残ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会结束 %3$@ 上 %2$@ 中的 %1$@ 并关闭其窗格。对话会保留在历史中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type an answer": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回答を入力"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入回答"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type an instruction for this session": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このセッションへの指示を入力"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "给这个会话输入指令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "what is on near you": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "近所のできごと"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你附近有什么"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An estimate from your documents and this year's settings: %@ taxable after %@ of itemized deductions (mortgage interest %@, state and local taxes %@, gifts %@). A state's tax on investment income is not counted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "書類とこの年の設定からの見積もりです。項目別控除 %2$@（住宅ローン利子 %3$@、州・地方税 %4$@、寄付 %5$@）を引いた課税所得は %1$@ です。投資所得への州税は含みません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "根据你的文件和本年度设置估算：减去分项扣除 %2$@（房贷利息 %3$@、州和地方税 %4$@、捐赠 %5$@）后应税收入为 %1$@。未计入州对投资收入征的税。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An estimate from your documents and this year's settings: %@ taxable after the %@ standard deduction and %@ of charitable gifts. A state's tax on investment income is not counted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "書類とこの年の設定からの見積もりです。標準控除 %2$@ と寄付 %3$@ を引いた課税所得は %1$@ です。投資所得への州税は含みません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "根据你的文件和本年度设置估算：减去 %2$@ 标准扣除额和 %3$@ 慈善捐款后应税收入为 %1$@。未计入州对投资收入征的税。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An estimate from your documents and this year's settings: %@ taxable after the %@ standard deduction. A state's tax on investment income is not counted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "書類とこの年の設定からの見積もりです。標準控除 %2$@ を引いた課税所得は %1$@ です。投資所得への州税は含みません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "根据你的文件和本年度设置估算：减去 %2$@ 标准扣除额后应税收入为 %1$@。未计入州对投资收入征的税。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An OpenAI admin key, used only to read what the organization was billed, so the prices below can follow the bill. Never sent with a model call.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenAI の管理者キーです。組織に請求された金額を読み取るためだけに使い、下の価格を請求額に合わせます。モデルの呼び出しには送信されません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenAI 管理员密钥，仅用于读取组织的账单金额，使下方的价格与账单保持一致。绝不会随模型调用发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
