            "state": "translated",
            "value": "常に画像を表示"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "始终显示图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always this zone": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "常にこのゾーン"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "固定为此时区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Amount": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "金額"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "金额"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An S3-compatible service that is not AWS. Leave empty for AWS itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AWS 以外の S3 互換サービス。AWS を使う場合は空のままにします。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "非 AWS 的 S3 兼容服务。使用 AWS 时留空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An address for Go’s profiling endpoints, off when empty. It has no authentication of its own, so bind it to 127.0.0.1 and nothing else.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Go のプロファイリング用アドレスで、空なら無効です。独自の認証を持たないので、127.0.0.1 だけに結び付けてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Go 性能分析端点的地址，留空即关闭。它自身没有任何鉴权，所以只绑定到 127.0.0.1。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An agent of your own: it can sort what arrives in your mailbox, summarize conversations, draft and, if you let it, answer replies, and do for you whatever you could do yourself. It is off until you turn it on, and it reaches nothing until you grant it a mailbox.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "あなた専用のエージェントです。届いたメールを仕分けし、会話を要約し、返信を下書きし、許可すれば返信を送り、あなた自身ができることを代わりに行います。有効にするまで動かず、メールボックスを許可するまで何にも触れません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "属于你的助手：它可以分拣到达邮箱的邮件、总结会话、起草回复，在你允许时替你回复，并替你做任何你自己能做的事。开启前它不会运行，授予邮箱前它不会接触任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An alias with an empty pattern is a catch-all: it receives whatever no other alias matched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "パターンが空のエイリアスはキャッチオールです。他のどのエイリアスにも一致しなかったメールを受け取ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匹配模式为空的别名是通配别名：所有未被其他别名匹配的邮件都归它接收。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An app that gave no name": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名前のないアプリ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未提供名称的应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An optional MaxMind database, read from disk, that turns the address a message arrived from into a country. Nothing is sent anywhere to do it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ディスクから読む任意の MaxMind データベースで、メールが届いたアドレスを国に変えます。そのために外へ何かを送ることはありません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可选的 MaxMind 数据库，从磁盘读取，把邮件来源地址换算成国家。整个过程不向外发送任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Announces itself as": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名乗る名前"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自我标识为"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another language": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "その他の言語"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其他语言"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answer": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "答える"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回答"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answer mail on my behalf, under the policy below": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以下の方針で私の代わりにメールに返信する"
          }
        },
