      }
    },
    "Every administrative change: who made it, from where, and the row before and after. What people do in their own mailboxes is not recorded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべての管理上の変更：誰が、どこから、変更前後の内容。各自のメールボックス内での操作は記録されません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一次管理变更：谁做的、从哪里、变更前后的记录。用户在自己邮箱里的操作不会被记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every browser signed in to this account is signed out and has to sign in again. This iPhone stays connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このアカウントにサインインしているすべてのブラウザーがサインアウトされ、もう一度サインインが必要になります。この iPhone は接続したままです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此账号下已登录的所有浏览器都会被登出，需要重新登录。这部 iPhone 保持连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every call any agent on this server made to a model, newest first. Open one to read it; what you say there goes to that agent as its person, and is logged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このサーバーのすべてのエージェントがモデルに行った呼び出しを、新しい順に。開くと読めます。そこで話しかけると、その人としてそのエージェントに届き、サーバーのログに残ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台服务器上所有助手对模型的每一次调用，最新的在前。打开可阅读；你在其中说的话会以该用户的身份传给其助手，并记入服务器日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every day": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "毎日"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every day at %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "毎日 %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每天 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every delivery has either succeeded or been given up on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべての配送は成功したか、断念されています。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有投递要么已成功，要么已放弃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every group that carried it loses it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このロールを持つすべてのグループが失います。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有持有它的群组都会失去它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every kind": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべての種類"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有类型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every message in Trash is removed. They cannot be brought back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ゴミ箱のメッセージはすべて削除され、元に戻せません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "废纸篓中的所有邮件都会被删除，且无法恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every month": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "毎月"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每月"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every question is dropped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべての質問が除外されています。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有问题都已舍弃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every skill the registry publishes, with its signature checked against the key this server ships with.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "レジストリが公開しているスキル。署名はこのサーバーに組み込まれた鍵で確認済みです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "注册表发布的每个技能，其签名已用本服务器内置的密钥校验。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every time it repeats is removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "繰り返しのすべてが削除されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有重复的日程都会被移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every time your agent tells you (a reminder, a brief, when a reply goes out) is in this zone. Following the browser means it moves when you travel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エージェントが伝える時刻（リマインダー、要約、返信が送られる時刻）はこのゾーンです。ブラウザに従うと旅先で移動します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "助手告诉你的每个时间（提醒、简报、回复发出的时刻）都以此时区显示。跟随浏览器意味着你旅行时它会随之变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every week": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "毎週"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每周"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every year": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "毎年"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每年"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everyone": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全員"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有人"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everyone in a group holds its roles: over its domains for the domain permissions, and everywhere for the rest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "グループの全員がそのロールを持ちます。ドメイン権限はグループのドメインに、それ以外はサーバー全体に及びます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "群组里的每个人都持有群组的角色：域名权限作用于群组的域名，其余权限作用于整个服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everyone with an account on this server. A person is put into Members unless told otherwise, so they can read the mailbox they are given.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このサーバーのすべてのアカウント。指定がなければ Members グループに入り、割り当てられたメールボックスを読めるようになります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此服务器上的所有账号。除非另行指定，新用户会被加入“Members”群组，以便读取分配给他们的邮箱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everyone with an account on this server. There is no Members group, so a new person joins no group and can sign in and read nothing until they are put in one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このサーバーのすべてのアカウント。Members グループが存在しないため、新しい人はどのグループにも入らず、グループに入れられるまではサインインできても何も読めません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此服务器上的所有账号。当前没有“Members”群组，所以新用户不会加入任何群组：在被加入群组之前，他们虽能登录，但什么也读不到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everyone with an agent: what it may reach and what it cost. Tokens and counts only; what an agent read or wrote belongs to the person.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エージェントを持つ全員: 何に触れられ、いくらかかったか。トークンと件数のみで、読み書きした内容は本人のものです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有拥有助手的人：它能访问什么、花费多少。仅有 token 与计数，助手读写的内容属于本人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべて"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全部"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything an operator can change is in the database, and most of it is on these pages. The listeners, TLS and the database connection are the exception: those are read when the server starts, and the About page says which ones a change is waiting on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "運用者が変更できる設定はデータベースにあり、その多くはこれらのページにあります。待ち受けアドレス、TLS、データベース接続は例外で、サーバー起動時に読み込まれます。どの変更が反映待ちかは「概要」ページが示します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运维人员能改的设置都存在数据库里，大部分就在这几个页面上。监听地址、TLS 和数据库连接是例外：它们在服务器启动时读取，“关于”页面会说明哪些更改正在等待重启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
