        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转发到 %@，通过查询其邮件服务器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found by words alone, not by meaning.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "意味ではなく語句だけで見つかりました。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅按字词匹配，而非按含义。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found in your own mail, memory and calendar. Nothing starts until you send the request it opens with.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "あなたのメール、記憶、カレンダーから見つけたものです。最初の依頼を送るまで何も始まりません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从你的邮件、记忆和日历中发现。在你发出它打开的请求之前，什么都不会开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Four sources, each switchable. The signals cost nothing and are on for every server; the classifier learns from the messages you mark.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4つのソースを個別に切り替えられます。シグナルはコストがかからず常に有効、分類器はマークしたメールから学習します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "四个来源，各自可开关。信号不耗资源且对每台服务器开启；分类器从你标记的邮件中学习。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free time": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "余暇"
          }
        },
