          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In queue": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "キュー内"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "队列中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the dashboard, open Settings, then Devices, and choose Connect a phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ダッシュボードで「設定」の「デバイス」を開き、「スマートフォンを接続」を選びます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在仪表板中打开设置，再打开设备，选择连接手机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In use": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用中"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In your quiet hours only what cannot wait is said; the rest waits for the morning. The same time at both ends means no quiet hours.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "静かな時間帯には待てないことだけを伝え、それ以外は朝まで待ちます。開始と終了が同じなら静かな時間帯はありません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安静时段只说等不了的事，其余的等到早上再说。开始和结束相同表示没有安静时段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inbox": {
