    "Off means this server uses only the certificate and key named below, and renewing them is your job.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切ると、このサーバーは下に指定した証明書と鍵だけを使い、更新はあなたの仕事になります。"
