            "state": "translated",
            "value": "税表"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tax-exempt interest": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "非課税利子"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "免税利息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taxed interest %@ so far, %@ by December 31; taxed dividends %@ so far, %@ by December 31. Counted until the 1099s come; dividends count as ordinary until a 1099-DIV says which are qualified. Accounts whose income isn't taxed, such as IRAs and HSAs, are left out.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "課税される利子は今まで %1$@、12 月 31 日までに %2$@。課税される配当は今まで %3$@、12 月 31 日までに %4$@。1099 が届くまで計上し、1099-DIV が適格配当を示すまで配当は普通配当として数えます。IRA や HSA など非課税の口座は除きます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应税利息至今 %1$@，到 12 月 31 日 %2$@；应税股息至今 %3$@，到 12 月 31 日 %4$@。在 1099 到来之前计入；在 1099-DIV 注明合格股息之前，股息按普通股息计算。IRA、HSA 等收入不征税的账户不计入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TeaNode app": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TeaNode アプリ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TeaNode 应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TeaNode could not ask your server what it runs. Check the connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TeaNode はサーバーで動いているサービスを確認できませんでした。接続を確認して、もう一度お試しください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TeaNode 无法向你的服务器查询其运行的服务。请检查网络连接后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Term not known": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "期間不明"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "期限未知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The answer from the transcription service was lost, so this recording was not transcribed. Transcribing it again is a new paid request.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字起こしサービスからの応答が失われたため、この録音は文字起こしされていません。もう一度文字起こしすると、新たな有料リクエストになります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转写服务的响应丢失了，因此这段录音没有转写。重新转写会是一次新的付费请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current address stops taking mail at once. Anything set to forward paystubs to it needs the new one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今のアドレスはすぐにメールを受け付けなくなります。給与明細の転送先に設定している場合は、新しいアドレスに変えてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前地址会立即停止接收邮件。设置了把工资单转发到这里的地方需要改用新地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The filing status is assumed from the number of people; pick yours above and it is kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "申告区分は人数から仮定しています。上で選ぶと保存されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "报税身份是根据人数假定的；在上方选择后会保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相同"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TeaNode app on your phones, and what each is told about.": {
      "localizations": {
