            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已撤回邀请"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nobody has shared their calendar with you yet. Ask the people you share a circle with to share theirs, at busy times or more.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "まだ誰もカレンダーをあなたに共有していません。サークルの仲間に、予定の有無だけでも共有してもらってください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有人把日历共享给你。请圈子里的人至少共享忙闲时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose who can see your calendar, and how much. An event you mark private is only ever shown to others as busy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "カレンダーを誰に、どこまで見せるかを選びます。非公開にした予定は、ほかの人には「予定あり」としてしか表示されません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择谁可以查看你的日历，以及可以看到多少。标记为私密的日程，别人只会看到“忙碌”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your agent asked to run %@ with %@’s %@ skill": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "あなたのエージェントが、%2$@さんのスキル「%3$@」で%1$@を実行しようとしました"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的助手想通过%2$@的技能“%3$@”运行%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That did not reach the chat: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
