          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They see everything, and can add, change and remove events that have no guests.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべて見え、参加者のいない予定を追加、変更、削除できます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对方可以看到全部内容，并且可以添加、修改和删除没有参与者的日程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing has been asked through this yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この共有ではまだ何も依頼されていません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有人通过这次共享发起过请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no time in those days and hours when everyone is free.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "その日にちと時間帯に、全員が空いている時間はありません。"
